  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "# 13_Cloud_AWS",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "📋 Panoramica",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "Cloud computing su Amazon Web Services. Piattaforma cloud leader di mercato con oltre 200 servizi tra compute, storage, database, networking, AI/ML e sicurezza.",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "> ⚠️ **Nessun materiale didattico presente** in `01_Materiale/`. Questa nota è un placeholder da integrare.",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "📚 Indice degli argomenti (attesi dal syllabus)",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "1. Fondamenti AWS",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "Global infrastructure: Regions, AZs, Edge Locations",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "AWS Management Console, CLI, SDK",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "IAM: Users, Groups, Roles, Policies (JSON)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "2. Compute",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**EC2**: Tipi di istanza, AMI, security groups, EBS, ELB, Auto Scaling",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Lambda**: Serverless, trigger, runtime, billing per invocazione",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**ECS / EKS**: Container orchestration (Fargate vs EC2)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "3. Storage",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**S3**: Bucket, classi storage, lifecycle, versioning, replication",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**EBS**: Volumi, snapshot, encryption",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**EFS**: File system condiviso NFS",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "4. Database",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**RDS**: MySQL, PostgreSQL, MariaDB, SQL Server, Oracle",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**DynamoDB**: NoSQL key-value/document",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**ElastiCache**: Redis, Memcached",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "5. Networking",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**VPC**: Subnet, route tables, Internet Gateway, NAT Gateway",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Security Groups vs NACL**",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**CloudFront**: CDN",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Route 53**: DNS",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "6. Sicurezza e Monitoring",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**CloudWatch**: Logs, metrics, alarms",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**CloudTrail**: Audit API calls",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**AWS Shield / WAF**: Protezione DDoS e firewall applicativo",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**KMS**: Key management, encryption",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "⚡ Punti Chiave",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "AWS ha il **market share maggiore** nel cloud (≈32% Q1 2025)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**IAM** è il fondamento della sicurezza — seguire il principio del minimo privilegio",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**S3** è storage object, non file system (consistenza read-after-write)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Lambda** si paga per invocazione e durata (arrotondato a 1ms)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "Tutti i servizi possono essere gestiti via **Infrastructure as Code** (CloudFormation/Terraform)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "📎 Risorse Collegate",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
